[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4232759794","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118498#issuecomment-4232759794","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118498","id":4232759794,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78Ssny","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T21:14:23Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T21:14:23Z","body":"I'm not sure if this is a bug or non-obvious behavior, but I encountered this issue myself and solved it by changing the `bus` property on the `AudioStreamPlayer` node itself, rather than passing this parameter. It's a similar issue with `volume_db`, but I don't remember where it's ignored: as the parameter or as the node property.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4232759794/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4232888085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118498#issuecomment-4232888085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118498","id":4232888085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78TL8V","user":{"login":"Meowlala","id":11726474,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzI2NDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11726474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala","html_url":"https://github.com/Meowlala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meowlala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T22:33:54Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T22:33:54Z","body":"In my case, I need to play multiple sounds on different buses using the same AudioStreamPlayer at the same time. The only workaround would be to have a separate AudioStreamPlayer for each bus, but avoiding that is why I was attempting to use AudioStreamPolyphonic in the first place.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4232888085/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4346295053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118498#issuecomment-4346295053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118498","id":4346295053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAw8zDQ","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T18:08:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T18:08:56Z","body":"Haven't tested this, but I looked at the engine source code and this appears to be confirmed non-obvious behavior, simply because it's not properly documented. The function was first created without a bus parameter, and the parameter was only added when sample playback support was added to the engine, and only samples make use of it. In other words, this only works for sample playback types.\nI think the best approach to fix this is to fix the documentation, which I'm already doing. Making the bus parameter work for stream types seems complicated, but I'd love to be proven wrong...\nI think you should look forward to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117430 ! It'd allow you to play back streams via code and specify which bus you want a stream to play on. If you're able to [review it](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/review_guidelines.html), that'd be great :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4346295053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]